    "description": "Assorted Crystal Cluster Lot\nNatural and Treated Specimens\nTotal Weight: 2 lbs\nThis curated lot features three distinct mineral specimens, showcasing natural geological formations and artisanal color enhancements. The set includes a substantial amethyst geode slice, displaying a dense concentration of deep purple crystalline structures within a rocky matrix. Accompanying this are two aura quartz clusters-one in vibrant golden-yellow and the other in rich magenta-red-each treated with a metallic vapor process to produce a striking iridescent, prismatic luster across the crystal terminations.\nNatural purple crystalline geode slice with deep violet terminations\nTwo iridescent treated quartz-style clusters with brilliant metallic finishes\nThree-piece specimen lot ideal for decor, collection, or display\nDiverse textures and colors ranging from earthy to prismatic\nCondition:\nVery good pre-owned condition. Stones exhibit natural terminations and textures inherent to mineral specimens. The purple crystals are intact with vibrant saturation. The iridescent coatings on the quartz clusters show consistent coverage and luster. No significant damage or repairs observed beyond natural geological variations.\nTHANK YOU FOR SUPPORTING OUR MISSION!\nIf there is a problem with your order, please contact us via Shop Goodwill before opening returns/claims. We strive to respond to all inquiries within 2 business days.\nOur business hours are Monday - Friday  7:00 am to 3:00 pm EST\n**If your item was damaged in transit, do not throw away anything, including the box or packing materials until we have authorized you to do so.\n**Photos will be required to file insurance claims.\nGoodwill of Western and Northern Connecticut strengthens communities by helping people with disabilities and other disadvantages maximize independence through job training and other support services.",
